A story yet to be titled, but a dream already taking shape with a magnificent team!

With the incredible Hansal Mehta as our Captain of the Ship, and a wonderful ensemble of talent featuring Sunny Kaushal, Bipasha Basu and Vishal Jethwa, this journey promises to be an extraordinary one.

Here’s to new beginnings, unforgettable collaborations and the magic of storytelling.

With Mahadev’s blessings, let another beautiful journey begin🙏🕉️🧿

